rsquo;s 6 grids in Owen County has a record running from 1951 to 2025. January to February came in under 90% of normal in 33 of those 75 years, and August to September did the same in 33. In 2025 the middle ran 56% of normal in January to February and 160% in June to July. So far in 2026 the middle shows 48% in January to February and 150% in May to June.</p>"}
